# datadock
===
 DataDock is a modern desktop database client that organizes databases the way developers actually work: Projects → Environments → Connections. Browse, edit, query and manage PostgreSQL, MySQL, SQLite, SQL Server, MongoDB, Redis and InfluxDB from one clean workspace.
